A '''scout ship'''<ref name="AotG">''[[Star Wars: Aliens of the Galaxy]]''</ref> (also spelled '''scout-ship''')<ref name="The Cold">''[[Adventures in Wild Space: The Cold]]''</ref> was any [[starship]] employed in exploration or reconnoitering.

==History==
When the [[Galactic Republic]] expanded from the [[Core Worlds|Core]], they sent such ships to explore new areas of [[Realspace|space]].<ref name="AotG" /> During the [[Imperial Era|reign]] of [[Galactic Emperor|Emperor]] [[Darth Sidious|Palpatine]], the [[Galactic Empire]] created a prototype scout ship, the ''[[Star Herald]]''.<ref name="The Cold" /> The [[Galaxy|Galactic]] [[Politics#Empire|Empire]] also made use of the [[TIE scout]], a [[starfighter]] model of the [[TIE series|TIE fighter series]], for reconnaissance missions.<ref name="Alphabet Squadron">[[Alphabet Squadron (novel)|''Alphabet Squadron'']]</ref> The [[JumpMaster 5000]] was another ship designed for long-distance reconnaissance missions and scouting new [[Hyperspace route|hyperlane]] routes.<ref name="SWZ">{{FFGXW2|set=Scum and Villainy Conversion Kit|cardname=Contracted Scout}}</ref>

The [[Guavian Death Gang]] piloted a scout ship called [[Avandor-class fighter/transport|''Avandor''-class fighter/transport]].<ref name="Kaz's Curse">{{Resistance|Kaz's Curse}}</ref> 

